* 03-zener-subckt.lib - generic 5.1 V zener as a subcircuit with local models
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.subckt ZENER_5V1 A K
D1 A K DF
DR K X DR
VZ X A 4.95
.model DF D(IS=1e-14 RS=1.5 CJO=150p M=0.33 VJ=0.75)
.model DR D(IS=1e-17 N=0.8 RS=2)
.ends ZENER_5V1
